.TH okf-jawn-move_folder 1  "move_folder " 
.SH NAME
okf\-jawn\-move_folder \- Move a folder with everything in it, archived items included, and rewrite every moved item\*(Aqs links in one committed change; a draft of a moved item stays with its item, and a folder changed since the base revision conflicts.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBokf\-jawn move_folder\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-server\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Move a folder with everything in it, archived items included, and rewrite every moved item\*(Aqs links in one committed change; a draft of a moved item stays with its item, and a folder changed since the base revision conflicts.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR \fI<JSON>\fR [default: {}]
The operation\*(Aqs JSON input: inline, @file, or \- for standard input
.TP
\fB\-\-server\fR \fI<URL>\fR [default: http://127.0.0.1:7711]
The service address: HTTPS, or HTTP for a loopback address
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
